  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.19 On-highway vehicle",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.19 \"On-highway vehicle\" means any motor vehicle of 4 wheels or more, duly licensed or registered with any motor vehicle division to travel over the public roads and highways of the state.\n\nSource. #591, eff 11-20-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4866, eff 7-19-90; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (from Pes 101.16)",
